rgin-top:6px;margin-bottom:6px\">dwb = c(&quot;123.csv&quot;)</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:6px\">dwc = c(&quot;kan.csv&quot;)</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:6px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:6px\">dwa 與 dwb 會 T</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:6px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:6px\">dwa 與 dwc 會 F</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:6px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:6px\">Orz</p></div></div></blockquote></div>"
